        <body>
            <div xml:id="d590">

                <pb facs="0857" n="743" xml:id="pg743"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1265: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Trueblood</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-02T21:00:00-04:32">July 2, 1931—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:45 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Paraguayan reply to second Bolivian note received and considered cordial but
                    unsatisfactory, hence instructions sent last night to the Bolivian Minister at
                    Asuncion to leave at once in that event are effective. Argentine offer of
                    mediation was withdrawn this afternoon.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Buenos Aires and Santiago.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Trueblood</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
